		(property "Description" "The Raspberry Pi 4 Model B SC0195-9 single board computer features a powerful Broadcom BCM2711 ARM Cortex-A72 processor with 1.5GHz speed and four cores, making it ideal for demanding embedded computing applications. With 8GB of RAM and a compact size of 3.346 x 2.205, this SBC offers robust performance in a small footprint. It includes 40 digital I/O lines, GbE Ethernet, and multiple USB ports (two USB 2.0 and two USB 3.0), providing versatile connectivity options. Additionally, it supports video outputs such as CSI, DSI, and HDMI, making it suitable for a wide range of multimedia projects."
